WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.976
The reader holds Reader
everywhere in scope,

3
00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:08.850
the security reader role where security
advisories matter, and nothing that writes.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.513
The settings name the cloud.

5
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:13.124
Learn's query and the
kit's collection agree.

6
00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:15.992
Every record validates,
and says whether the

7
00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:18.937
provider or a kit rule
made it action required.

8
00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:23.674
The alert plan's hash was approved by
someone other than the person who applies it,

9
00:00:23.674 --> 00:00:26.855
the alert rule exists in
each subscription untouched,

10
00:00:26.855 --> 00:00:28.975
and the rollback has been rehearsed.

11
00:00:28.975 --> 00:00:33.712
Next, Chapter 2 fills the same
record from Microsoft 365.

12
00:00:33.712 --> 00:00:34.870
Thanks for watching.
